@startuml
title Reliable Task recover() 判定状态

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

state "Recovery\nAtomic Decision" as DECISION <<choice>>
state "STALE_CANDIDATE\n扫描快照已过期" as STALE
state "NOT_RECOVERABLE\nrecoveryMode=NONE / window ended" as NOTREC
state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
state "FAILED_FINAL" as FINAL
state "SUCCESS" as SUCCESS
state "RECOVERY_ACQUIRED\nnew owner\nversion + 1" as ACQUIRED
state "BUSINESS EXECUTION" as EXECUTION

[*] --> DECISION : recover(expectedOwner, expectedVersion)
DECISION --> STALE : owner/version 已变化
DECISION --> NOTREC : 不允许恢复
DECISION --> SUCCESS : 当前已成功
DECISION --> ACTIVE : PROCESSING 仍未超时
DECISION --> FINAL : FAILED 不可恢复
DECISION --> ACQUIRED : PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n或 FAILED_RETRYABLE

ACQUIRED --> EXECUTION : callback(recoveryExecution=true)
EXECUTION --> SUCCESS : markSuccess CAS
EXECUTION --> FINAL : markFailed(retryable=false)
EXECUTION --> DECISION : markFailed(retryable=true)\n等待下一次任务

STALE --> [*]
NOTREC --> [*]
ACTIVE --> [*]
SUCCESS --> [*]
FINAL --> [*]

note bottom of ACQUIRED
接管本身由 Repository 原子完成。
任务扫描/调度/MQ 不属于幂等 Core。
end note

@enduml
